{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51865","headline":"桃川宫（方士，失名） · 无名氏","name":"桃川宫（方士，失名）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流水回环日夕澄，烟萝石壁四时新。\n清风台上生瑶草，夜雨松根老茯苓。\n九转丹砂龙虎伏，千年剑气鬼神惊。\n道人今向蓬莱去，白鹤归来月满庭。\n（同上一二六二《常德府部》。\n又同治《湖南通志》二四○《方外志·寺观·桃源县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}